<PageIntro text="Allmaps makes digitized maps easier to find and use across collections and institutions." />

Allmaps helps people georeference and explore maps from libraries, archives and
museums around the world. Its [open source tools](/open-source) work across
collections, and the resulting georeference data becomes part of a
[shared, open database](/data) that anyone can use.

The images stay with the institutions that publish them through IIIF. The
georeference data is open and reusable, so the work people contribute can remain
useful beyond Allmaps itself.

